commit af09eecf
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 11:46:06 -0600
subject: feat(observability): add conversationId tracking + fix streaming non-SSE detail capture

P0-a: streamingHandler.js non-SSE blocked path now calls saveRequestDetail
  (was the only exit path missing observability coverage). Captures sanitized
  upstream body, status 'error', fire-and-forget.

P0-b: schema.js — add nullable conversationId TEXT column + idx_uh_conversation /
  idx_rd_conversation indexes to usageHistory and requestDetails. Bump
  SCHEMA_VERSION 1→2 (additive auto-sync handles migration, version bump
  triggers pre-change safety backup).

P0-c: requestDetail.js — buildRequestDetail() and saveUsageStats() accept and
  forward conversationId (undefined-safe, zero breaking change).

P0-d: pipeline wiring — handleChat() resolves conversationId from
  x-conversation-id header or extra_body.conversation_id; chatCore.js
  destructures + adds to sharedCtx; all sub-handlers (streaming,
  nonStreaming, sseToJson, onStreamComplete) persist it to requestDetails
  and usageHistory. requestDetailsRepo/usageRepo INSERTs updated.

Verified: production build passes; targeted tests show 7 failures identical
to baseline HEAD (pre-existing, zero new regressions).

Part of: Observability & Conversation Analytics plan (Phase P0)


